-- Step 142. More Australian bachelors scholarships (and a few small awards and grants) from the second round of web research, 1 Nov 2026.
-- SOURCE: web-search results (ChatGPT). The official pages could not be opened from here, so NOTHING below is confirmed.
-- Each row starts with "NOT YET CHECKED" and has verified = false. Links are the school's own pages as given in the search answer.
-- Left out: awards that exclude Ghana or need an Australian visa or a humanitarian or asylum status, Australia Awards (masters only for Ghana),
-- English-only course discounts, and former awards that no longer run.
-- Safe to run more than once, and safe whether or not step141 has been run: a row that already exists (same school and name, not yet checked)
-- is refreshed with this fuller text, and a row that does not exist is added.
